<div class="adv4">

  <!-- ARTICLE HEADER -->
  <article class="wrap adv4-art">
    <div class="adv4-cat">A no-needle alternative to GLP-1 injections</div>
    <h1 class="adv4-h1">Most weight management plans want time you don't have. WLP-1&trade; just wants 30 seconds in the morning.</h1>
    <p class="adv4-deck">Keep the midnight snack. Order Wednesday takeout. Skip the gym for the soccer carpool. WLP-1&trade; still works, <b>~9 lbs</b><span class="adv4-ast">*</span> in 4 weeks.</p>
    <div class="adv4-meta">
      <span>By <b>The Absorption Company</b></span>
      <span class="adv4-meta__dot"></span>
      <span>{{ pub_date }}</span>
      <span class="adv4-meta__read">4 min read</span>
    </div>

    <!-- LEAD IMAGE -->
    <figure class="adv4-lead">
      <img src="{{ hero_img }}" alt="WLP-1 by The Absorption Company" loading="eager">
      <figcaption class="adv4-lead__cap"><b>WLP-1</b>, a plant-based GLP-1 alternative built for daily life.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <!-- BODY -->
    <div class="adv4-body">

      <p class="lead">Every weight management plan you've tried asked you to subtract something. Skip the bread. Skip the wine. Skip the kid's leftovers. Skip sleep, for cardio.</p>

      <p><b>WLP-1 is the first one that doesn't.</b></p>

      <h2>Keep doing exactly what you're doing.</h2>

      <p>Two capsules with your morning coffee. That's the whole plan.</p>

      <p>You're not giving up the midnight snack. You're not cancelling the Wednesday takeout. You're not waking up at 5am for a class you'd resent by week three. Your life stays the same. The scale moves anyway.</p>

      <a href="#buy" class="adv4-jump"><span class="adv4-jump__lbl"><small>See pricing</small>Try WLP-1 risk-free</span><span class="adv4-jump__arrow">↓</span></a>

      <h2>You've thought about GLP-1 injections.</h2>

      <p>A lot of moms have. They work. They also mean a doctor's appointment, a $1,000+ monthly bill, and a needle in your stomach. Plus explaining to your kids why mom is giving herself a shot in the kitchen.</p>

      <p>We built <b>WLP-1</b> as the other way to get there. Same biology. None of the production.</p>

      <h2>This is WLP-1.</h2>

      <p>Three clinically studied plant extracts that support your body's own GLP-1 signal. It works on three things at once.</p>

      <div class="adv4-mech">
        <div class="adv4-mech__card">
          <svg class="adv4-mech__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18"/><path d="M5 8h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/><path d="M8 8V6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2"/></svg>
